flowchart TB
  User[User] --> Client[Web / mobile client]
  Client --> Edge[DNS / CDN / edge protection]
  Edge --> LB[Load balancer / reverse proxy]
  LB --> App[Application instances]
  App --> DB[(Primary database)]
  App --> Cache[(Cache)]
  App --> Queue[Queue / event stream]
  Queue --> Worker[Background workers]
  Worker --> DB
  Worker --> Search[(Search / analytics)]
  Obs[Logs / metrics / traces] -. observe .-> Edge
  Obs -. observe .-> App
  Obs -. observe .-> DB
